[{"client_msg_id":"61937a08-778a-437f-9b55-ae1963c75a62","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"\u003chttps://github.blog/2021-08-16-highlights-from-git-2-33/\u003e\n後で読むか","ts":"1629163631.036000","attachments":[{"fallback":"The GitHub Blog: Highlights from Git 2.33 | The GitHub Blog","id":1,"title":"Highlights from Git 2.33 | The GitHub Blog","title_link":"https://github.blog/2021-08-16-highlights-from-git-2-33/","text":"The open source Git project just released Git 2.33, with features and bug fixes from over 74 contributors. Here's a look at some of the most interesting features and changes.","image_url":"https://github.blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/git2-33_social-card.png?fit=1200%2C630","blocks":null,"ts":1629155727,"service_name":"The GitHub Blog","service_icon":"https://github.blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/cropped-github-favicon-512.png?fit=180%2C180","from_url":"https://github.blog/2021-08-16-highlights-from-git-2-33/","original_url":"https://github.blog/2021-08-16-highlights-from-git-2-33/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"283E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c8d3430-8af0-4157-9447-55fc1a7c0834","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"`/usr/local/share` 配下はこれしかない\nなんでだろ:thinking_face:\n```drwxr-xr-x root wheel 192 B  2021-06-10 09:34:15  .\ndrwxr-xr-x root wheel 192 B  2021-06-03 10:26:29  ..\ndrwxr-xr-x root wheel 1.0 KB 2021-06-10 09:34:15  locale\ndrwxr-xr-x root wheel 800 B  2021-03-15 13:11:45  man\ndrwxr-xr-x root wheel  96 B  2021-06-10 09:34:15  nvim\ndrwxr-xr-x root wheel  96 B  2021-01-31 10:51:37  vim```","ts":"1629160515.035500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Vs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d9cfdbd-36f0-40f5-8251-82f6938568c0","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C011V4T7VJP/p1629097963010600\u003e\nを試そうと思ったら、/usr/local/share/git-core が無くて探し回っていたら /opt/homebrew/Cellar/git/2.32.0_1/share/git-core/contrib/diff-highlight/diff-highlight にあった。。。","ts":"1629160402.035000","thread_ts":"1629160402.035000","attachments":[{"fallback":"りんごとバナナとエンジニア: gitのdiff-highlightを使い始めた - りんごとバナナとエンジニア","id":1,"title":"gitのdiff-highlightを使い始めた - りんごとバナナとエンジニア","title_link":"https://udomomo.hatenablog.com/entry/2019/12/01/181404","text":"git log -p や git diff などで差分を見るとき、行単位での追加/削除は表示されるが、行の中のどこが変わったのかは表示してくれない。例えば行の中の一単語を書き換えただけで、しかもその行が長い場合、どこに差分があるのか目で探すのが結構大変だった。 しかし先日、 diff-highlight という便利なモジュールが提供されていることを知り、早速導入してみた。 diff-highlightとは \u003chttp://github.com|github.com\u003e gitコマンドの、行単位での差分を探す動作のポストプロセスとして実行され、同じ行の中の差分をハイライトしてくれる。 例えば、行の一部分だけ変えたときの git diff…","image_url":"https://cdn-ak.f.st-hatena.com/images/fotolife/U/Udomomo/20191201/20191201171052.png","blocks":null,"ts":1575191644,"service_name":"りんごとバナナとエンジニア","service_icon":"https://udomomo.hatenablog.com/icon/touch","from_url":"https://udomomo.hatenablog.com/entry/2019/12/01/181404","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C011V4T7VJP/p1629097963010600"}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jiO6a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33628000-1AD9-4A54-8C31-E1B874A33222","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ありがとうございます","ts":"1629154895.033700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yZkd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A86AC158-47C8-4904-81C6-17710B6C39F4","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"これ使ってみます","ts":"1629154892.033500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Na6mo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75C0A344-0A3D-40EB-A91C-D61DCA6A52BC","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"求めてたやつだ","ts":"1629154872.033300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GAaea"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D3A64BE5-12A3-45D2-AB98-9B5575A38D09","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://www.google.co.jp/amp/s/kakakakakku.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/04/15/092256%3famp=1|https://www.google.co.jp/amp/s/kakakakakku.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/04/15/092256%3famp=1\u003e","ts":"1629154865.032900","attachments":[{"fallback":"kakakakakku blog: git worktree コマンドを使って複数ブランチを並行して操作する - kakakakakku blog","id":1,"title":"git worktree コマンドを使って複数ブランチを並行して操作する - kakakakakku blog","title_link":"https://www.google.co.jp/amp/s/kakakakakku.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/04/15/092256%3famp=1","text":"個人で使っている Git リポジトリ（GitHub リポジトリ）の中に「複数ブランチを並行して操作する頻度が高いリポジトリ」がある．例えば，以下のように「4個」のブランチがあり，どれも操作する可能性がある場合など．今までは頻繁にコミット（git commit コマンド）をしてからブランチを切り替えたり，一時的に退避（git stash コマンド）をしていたけど，頻度が高くなると少し面倒だった． master or main ブランチ branch-a ブランチ branch-b ブランチ branch-c ブランチ git-worktree（git worktree コマンド） 操作を改善する…","image_url":"https://cdn-ak.f.st-hatena.com/images/fotolife/k/kakku22/20210413/20210413124428.png","blocks":null,"ts":1618446176,"service_name":"kakakakakku blog","service_icon":"https://kakakakakku.hatenablog.com/icon/touch","from_url":"https://www.google.co.jp/amp/s/kakakakakku.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/04/15/092256%3famp=1","original_url":"https://www.google.co.jp/amp/s/kakakakakku.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/04/15/092256%3famp=1"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EZ/9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a1f90859-300e-4a5d-9dec-c783fb858ff3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"1. 未コミットをstashしてswitch\n2. やっぱりworktree \u003chttps://qiita.com/yoichi22/items/8f92110f24690ca8966f\u003e\nかね?","ts":"1629154693.032700","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: git worktreeを使ってみる - Qiita","id":1,"title":"git worktreeを使ってみる - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/yoichi22/items/8f92110f24690ca8966f","text":"git worktree を使うと、一つのローカルリポジトリで作業ツリーを複数同時に持てる。 このコマンドは Git 2.5.