ge","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"`git worktree add {path} {branch}`？","ts":"1629151361.031600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+N0oD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d4db707-c5b8-45cd-b485-47c9dd21a83c","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ありがとうございます","ts":"1629132423.029100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kuP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2887986f-ecc3-4266-bfde-7e2de663eff9","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"そうですね\n慎重に作業するときは一度コミット、それ以外はそのままcloneする\nで使い分けるのが自分的に良さそうな気がしました\n\nちょっとそれでしばらく運用してみます","ts":"1629132410.028900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HFZq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"CAE2D8A5-BAB1-4559-AB18-6DD3E32915C0","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"もちろん複数クローンするのもありですけね。分散型なので。","ts":"1629132269.027400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C0A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"AE8D8E76-C094-4F42-A50B-F492D45F9933","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"なるほど。やっぱりコミットするのが一番安全だと思いますよ。ほぼ絶対に作業が失われないので","ts":"1629132204.026200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+iPfg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f56718ac-7960-4949-9254-57f1929715a7","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"普段は↑のやりかたでやっています","ts":"1629132123.024600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iUnS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4491af5c-0dcc-498e-a209-e3e6dec44dec","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; 一度コミットして、作業ブランチにスイッチして変更をコミットして元のブランチにスイッチしてコミットをリセットするのではダメなんですか？\nそれでもいいんですが、もっとサクッとできる方法ないかなって思った次第です","ts":"1629132108.024100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1+n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3da5b7b7-8a07-4fb7-a5f5-e74fe8315af4","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"clone -\u0026gt; 作業 -\u0026gt; push -\u0026gt; 削除\nでいいのか","ts":"1629132075.023700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D8eKh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F3171DC8-F890-403C-A481-2815F708543E","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"一度コミットして、作業ブランチにスイッチして変更をコミットして元のブランチにスイッチしてコミットをリセットするのではダメなんですか？","ts":"1629132073.023600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J9Kcu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"095ee8b8-2a1a-4ecb-9e4c-c9ebfba93ab6","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あー、cloneしたらsubmoduleになるって勘違いしてた","ts":"1629132060.023000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CCE9F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c701e17-f5b0-40c1-875f-5a7c7211088a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"(submoduleに関してはリポジトリ内に別リポジトリへのリンクを埋める機能なので違いそうです)","ts":"1629130899.019900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tv/6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3598aff1-07b4-47e0-9eaa-00498db22249","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"試してたらできた","ts":"1629130669.019800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Spg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21f02e45-82d9-4e7f-a91f-09cc37637791","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"worktreeあるリポジトリだとpush弾かれたような気がするんだよなー","ts":"1629130426.019700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7WnF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2f042ea-0441-47cd-b851-22eb8063eca2","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"cloneして作業してpush?(できるか試してないです)","ts":"1629130395.019600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wv+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9d26bf4-c1f0-44a1-8739-7ef5ea051fb2","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"質問です\n変更がまだaddされていない状態のブランチを弄らず（switch、stashなど）、特定のブランチをちょっといじりたい場合はどうするのが一番良いでしょうか？\nパッと思いつくのがsubmoduleですが、他にもっとサクッとできそうな方法があれば知りたいです","ts":"1629129736.019500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4aM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2826113a-0841-48f1-a2e7-db575c8f658b","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"参考になるか分かりませんが、わたしはcontrib/diff-highlight にいって make して実行ファイルを作ってからpathの通る場所(~/bin/)にln -s しました。","ts":"1629167025.036200","thread_ts":"1629160402.035000","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nYy/"}]}]
